<view class="wrap">
  <view wx:if="{{notFound}}" class="card empty">
    <view>这座副本不在本站收录的名单里。</view>
    <view class="muted">地址里的编号是 <text class="mono">{{id}}</text>。可能是分享时用的旧编号，也可能是还没收录的本。下面回到列表按名字找。</view>
    <view class="btn gold" bindtap="onBack">回到副本列表</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{loaded}}">
    <view wx:if="{{requiresUpdate}}" class="notice notice-bad">
      这批数据的结构比当前小程序新，字段可能显示不全。请更新小程序后再看。
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{needOnline}}" class="notice">
      现在是打包快照：下面只有列表里就有的字段，<text class="bold">首领名单与掉落要联网才能取</text>。
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{offline}}" class="notice">
      当前显示的是{{sourceText}}，可能不是最新核对结果。
    </view>

    <view class="hero">
      <view class="hero-art">
        <icon-cell src="{{artUrl}}" size="hero" fallback-text="这座还没有原画" />
        <view wx:if="{{artUrl}}" class="art-note">{{artNote}}</view>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-title">
        {{title}}
        <text wx:if="{{nameMissing}}" class="todo">中文名待核</text>
      </view>
      <view class="muted hero-en">
        <text wx:if="{{!enMissing}}" class="nameen">{{nameEn}}</text>
        <text wx:else class="todo">英文名待补</text>
        <text wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="conflict">另一说法：{{conflict}}（本站当前取上面这个）</text>
      </view>
      <view class="hero-meta">
        <text class="tag">{{kindLabel}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="row actions">
        <view class="btn {{fav ? 'btn-on' : ''}}" bindtap="onFav">{{fav ? '★ 已收藏' : '☆ 收藏'}}</view>
        <view class="btn" bindtap="onCopy">复制这座的资料</view>
        <view class="spacer"></view>
        <button class="btn btn-share" open-type="share">分享给微信好友</button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">这座本的关键信息</view>
      <view class="frow" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="k">
        <view class="fkey">{{item.k}}</view>
        <view class="fval">
          <view>{{item.v}}</view>
          <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="muted fnote">{{item.note}}</view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">首领名单</view>
      <view wx:if="{{bossEmpty}}" class="muted">{{bossEmpty}}</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{needOnline}}" class="muted">首领名单要联网才能取（现在只有列表里就有的字段）。</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{bosses.length === 0}}" class="muted">这座还没有首领记录，不猜。</view>
      <view class="boss" wx:for="{{bosses}}" wx:key="index">
        <view class="boss-face">
          <icon-cell wx:if="{{item.hasPortrait}}" src="{{item.portraitUrl}}" size="md" label="{{item.name}}" fallback-text="没有这张头像" />
          <view wx:else class="face-none">没有这张头像</view>
        </view>
        <view class="boss-main">
          <text class="boss-name">{{item.name}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.missing}}" class="todo">待核</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">掉落（按经典旧世公开数据库推的，本站不写几率）</view>
      <view wx:if="{{needOnline}}" class="muted">掉落分片还没取到，联网后再看。</view>
      <view wx:elif="{{drops.length === 0}}" class="muted">这座还没有掉落记录，不猜。</view>
      <view wx:else>
        <view class="drop" wx:for="{{drops}}" wx:key="index">
          <view class="drop-face">
          <icon-cell src="{{item.iconUrl}}" size="sm" label="{{item.name}}" />
        </view>
        <view class="drop-main">
            <text class="drop-name">{{item.name}}</text>
            <text class="muted drop-boss">{{item.boss ? '出自 ' + item.boss : '首领未标注'}}</text>
          </view>
          <view class="drop-side">
            <text class="muted">{{item.quality}}</text>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title prov-head" bindtap="onProvToggle">
        来源<text class="muted prov-toggle">{{provOpen ? '收起 ‹' : '展开 ›'}}</text>
      </view>
      <block wx:if="{{provOpen}}">
      <view wx:if="{{prov.length === 0}}" class="muted">这座还没有逐条来源记录。</view>
      <view class="prov" wx:for="{{prov}}" wx:key="url" data-url="{{item.url}}" bindtap="onOpenSource">
        <view class="row">
          <text class="prov-type">{{item.type}}</text>
          <view class="spacer"></view>
          <text class="muted">核对 {{item.checkedAt}}</text>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.note}}" class="prov-note">{{item.note}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.url}}" class="muted prov-url">{{item.url}}</view>
        <view wx:else class="muted">这条没留链接</view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted">点一条来源可复制它的链接，到浏览器里打开原页核对。缺数据的字段显示「待实测」，不机翻、不编造。</view>
      </block>
    </view>

    <view class="foot">非官方粉丝资料站，与暴雪娱乐及网易无关。</view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="card muted">正在取这座本的详情…</view>
</view>
